      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After finding a way to exploit this, I now prefer this behavior while we wait for a fix for OnOwnershipTransfer. I did find that owner assignment is inconsistent:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/object-sync-ownership-is-inconsistent-when-spawned-vs-starting-in-the-world",
